---
// colophon.astro
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ExternalLink from '@/components/base/ExternalLink.astro';

const pageTitle = `Colophon`;
---

<BaseLayout hasOwnTitle={false} pageTitle={pageTitle}>
    <article class="flow page">
        <h2>Xhor.haus</h2>
        <p>
            The domain and its TLD are simply a funny use of the word <em>Xhorhaus</em>, the house
            granted to The Mighty Nein in Campaign 2 of Critical Role. This is my nerdy place on
            the internet. I hope I do 'em proud!
        </p>

        <h2>Design &amp; Build</h2>

        <p>
            This site is built with Astro, served as static files via Cloudflare, with the source
            hosted publically on GitHub.
        </p>
        <p>
            This is a personal project, archiving and going back to owning my content like in the
            noughties. I'm leaning into learning with transparency around my explorations.
            Xhor.haus went live in October 2026 and aims to meet WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility
            standards but is very much a work in progress.
        </p>

        <h2>Policy</h2>
        <p>
            No personal data, no cookies. The only thing stored in your browser is your theme
            choice (light, dark or system), kept in local storage so the site remembers it. It
            never leaves your device. The only analytics are Cloudflare's basic traffic metrics,
            and honestly I couldn't care less about those.
        </p>

        <h2>Credits</h2>

        <p>
            Helpful links that made a difference to my site. Not complete, will be adding links
            ASAP.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <ExternalLink
                    href="https://piccalil.li/blog/my-favourite-3-lines-of-css/"
                    label="piccalil.li"
                /><em class="credit-desc">My favourite 3 lines of CSS </em>
            </li>
            <li>
                <ExternalLink
                    href="https://www.joshwcomeau.com/css/surprising-truth-about-pixels-and-accessibility/"
                    label="joshwcomeau.com"
                /><em class="credit-desc">The Surprising Truth About Pixels and Accessibility</em>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    ul {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: var(--space-md);
        padding-left: var(--space-xl);
    }
    li {
        padding-left: var(--space-sm);
        line-height: var(--leading-sub);
    }

    li::marker {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        content: '— ';
        transition: color var(--transition-smooth);
    }

    li:hover::marker {
        color: var(--text);
    }

    em.credit-desc::before {
        content: '—';
        display: inline;
        margin-inline: var(--space-xs);
    }
</style>
